TEXT -232 -704 Left 7 ;Emtex example with 2 pv-slacks in Bus 3 and 5\nnow with .TRAN analysis and sweep q7-load from -0.3 till 2 !!!\nnow without voltage breakdown at high q load of load7 (example with normalized to 1 values)
